## AggregateExec Partial and FinalPartitioned
  case default:
    AggregateExec: mode=FinalPartitioned, gby=[g@0 as g, h@1 as h], aggr=[count(v), sum(v), min(v), max(v), avg(f), sum(f)]
      RepartitionExec: partitioning=Hash([g@0, h@1], 3), input_partitions=3
        AggregateExec: mode=Partial, gby=[g@0 as g, h@1 as h], aggr=[count(v), sum(v), min(v), max(v), avg(f), sum(f)]
          MockSourceExec: partitioning=UnknownPartitioning(3), partition_rows=[200, 0, 400], statistics=Exact
    [lint] streams_released at RepartitionExec (root/0): after the output streams were dropped part way, the streams of partitions [0, 1, 2] of child 0 were only dropped once the plan itself was dropped; the plan keeps input streams, or tasks that poll them, alive
  case single partition: no violations
  case inexact statistics: no violations
  case absent statistics: no violations
  case empty input: no violations

