## AggregateExec Partial and FinalPartitioned with TopK limit
  case default:
    AggregateExec: mode=FinalPartitioned, gby=[g@0 as g], aggr=[max(v)], lim=[5]
      RepartitionExec: partitioning=Hash([g@0], 3), input_partitions=3
