          MockSourceExec: partitioning=UnknownPartitioning(3), partition_rows=[200, 0, 400], statistics=Exact
    [lint] streams_released at RepartitionExec (root/0): after the output streams were dropped part way, the streams of partitions [0, 1, 2] of child 0 were only dropped once the plan itself was dropped; the plan keeps input streams, or tasks that poll them, alive
