    [invariant] exact_statistics_hold at AggregateExec (root/0/0): the partition 2 statistics are false: distinct_count of g@0 is Exact(325), but the output has Exact(10); min_value of g@0 is Exact(Int32(5)), but the output has Exact(Int32(283)); max_value of g@0 is Exact(Int32(982)), but the output has Exact(Int32(935))
  case single partition:
    AggregateExec: mode=FinalPartitioned, gby=[g@0 as g], aggr=[max(v)], lim=[5]
      RepartitionExec: partitioning=Hash([g@0], 3), input_partitions=1
        AggregateExec: mode=Partial, gby=[g@0 as g], aggr=[max(v)], lim=[5]
