    [invariant] exact_statistics_hold at AggregateExec (root/0/0): the overall statistics are false: distinct_count of g@0 is Exact(437), but the output has Exact(10); min_value of g@0 is Exact(Int32(1)), but the output has Exact(Int32(8)); max_value of g@0 is Exact(Int32(997)), but the output has Exact(Int32(976))
